G 613 5 0 TEXT 0,0,0 0 0 0 255,255,255 0 2844 1193 1000 0 "Arial" 0 | 24352,451590 1 0 0 "Received Bytes to Rx Ctrl:\nByte 1: Number of Quadwords\nByte 0: Command Op Code\n Bit 3: No Address Increment\n Bit 2: ACK Request \n Bit 1: not Return to Sender\n Bit 0: is Write\n\nInfo Word (written to RX Info FIFO):\nBits 15 - 8: Number of Quadwords\nBits: 7-4: Not Used for Info Fifo\nBit 3: No Address Increment\nBit 2: ACK Request\nBit 1: not Return to Sender\nBit 0: is Write\n\nTo Tx Info FIFO from CommDec:\nBit 7: CRC Error since reset\nBit 6: CRC Detected in received packet\nBit 5: RX Fifo overflow since reset\nBit 4: protocol err since reset\nBits 3-0: Command opcode\n Bit 3: No Address Increment\n Bit 2: ACK Request\n Bit 1: not Return to Sender\n Bit 0: is Write"
